# HACKONEX Submission

## Solution

Outage Watch is a replayable, dependency-aware monitoring system for the
provided six-hour outage scenario. Run `python solution/app.py --report` to
generate the incident report, or `python solution/app.py --serve` to open the
dashboard.

The system combines robust per-service baselines, sustained trend detection,
reverse dependency traversal, and configuration-change ranking to identify the
earliest intervention point and likely originating change.